{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52731","headline":"丹元子步天歌 北方七宿 六 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 北方七宿 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"室，两星上有离宫出。\n遶室三双有六星，下头六个雷电形。\n垒壁陈次十二星，十二两头大似升。\n阵下分布羽林军，四十五卒三爲羣。\n壁西星多难论，子细历历看区分。\n三粒黄金名鈇钺，一颗真珠北落门。\n门东八魁九个子，门西一宿天纲是。\n电傍两星土功吏，腾蛇室上二十二。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}